{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff935c25e24dcb9065b986e9f096613b73796b96d68d40d503175846797aa6ea", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのオーディションは、\n順調に進んでいる。さて、次の応募者は……）", "zh": "（39PROJECT的甄选\n进行得十分顺利。下一位报名者是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "60ac3e5284c57cc3c0e94f49f152cc9377fa520b989c7463b21e0cdd38f6b051", "ja": "豊川風花です。\nよ、よろしくお願いしますっ。", "zh": "我叫做丰川风花。\n请、请多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "336c02d3c7a65a3616a923a1f954fa31adb116aacbb02617920d9a9377ff3173", "ja": "（す、すごいな、この子。\nこのルックス……思わず圧倒されるな）", "zh": "（好、好惊人啊，这女生。\n她的外表……实在太令人惊艳了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "99ceff1e5d446ebc05930bfdcad758661bd7b97a7026a4b92b2893014b8907e0", "ja": "年齢は22歳。\n今は、看護師として働いています。", "zh": "我今年22岁。\n现在的工作是护理师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a01b0a14cbf7ef99d0f13f3f88b681f69b40d35e6b51bf4a7dda8684c374e1ce", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。……ちなみに、\n豊川さんは以前、芸能活動はしていましたか？", "zh": "好的，感谢你自我介绍……顺便问一下，\n丰川小姐，请问你以前从事过演艺活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b00bc6675003fb4fa6f900b582d6508a6a190e0ad583ef6bdcbee29adea370bc", "ja": "え？\nいえ、したことありませんけど……。", "zh": "咦？\n不，我没有相关经验……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f630909c0daac91d97bb61a5dbed5119f03dc3a1c49f70c43c76112fec512870", "ja": "（このルックスで、芸能活動の経験はないのか。\nスカウトの目にも引っかからなかったなんて……）", "zh": "（她的外表如此出众，却没有演艺相关经验吗？\n居然没被星探发掘……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d89ae3d2c6453e049463de9a017044303f91b2822918465a0ffd1418ea039bee", "ja": "ありがとうございます。では、アイドルを志望した\n動機から聞かせてもらえますか？", "zh": "谢谢你的回答。那么，\n请你先说说来应征偶像的动机吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "81a96a28b4b8875b6b982eb9858ec36265966b83cdabd6b15af18f819e6159e2", "ja": "はい！\n私、もともとアイドルに興味があったんです。", "zh": "好的！\n我原本就对偶像很有兴趣了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "879b03a7f2b9a50a1a8eb27b5863bad2c4ceb5052f7e8caf9b8b5a8989bb7e19", "ja": "けど、アイドルって綺麗な子ばかりだから。\n私には無理だろうって、ずっと思っていて……。", "zh": "可是，偶像都长得好漂亮，\n以前我一直觉得自己不适合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b26f6eb9dad3c3343f12cfe1e05f4557038ed40502a87ac301996776f1c13806", "ja": "（十分、綺麗な子だと思うけどな……\nスタイルもいいし。自覚がないのかな？）", "zh": "（但我觉得她已经算很漂亮了……\n身材也很好。可能是她没有自觉？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f8bcda0b1102bbadcc540e190c849ba27ae838964b058ff8bdea6262743bf5d1", "ja": "人のお世話をするのが嫌いじゃなかったので、\n看護師の道を選んだんです。", "zh": "因为我也挺喜欢照顾人的，\n所以最后选择当护理师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b08b4bb82d4831f9ce5a5e119347457b8099d20ed9756bcea8d871d70720c6fc", "ja": "アイドルと看護師……\n仕事としては、大分印象が違いますね。", "zh": "偶像和护理师……\n这两项工作的形象大相迳庭呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "46a654420c5dff085efe12b3d8ffe7c06ba2f702b6bccacec159382cbf32e6a6", "ja": "はい。でも、私がしたことが誰かの役に立ったり……\n「喜んでもらいたい」っていう意味では、同じです♪", "zh": "是的。可是，自己的行为能帮助到别人……\n就「想要造福他人」这点来说，两者是一样的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "872729dd1f6dca3afc06ff9a7cf8204703b3fe67c8f33a55526911dbb89b2876", "ja": "でも、ある日……アイドルになるのが夢だったことを\n患者さんに話したら、私ならなれる、って言われて。", "zh": "不过，有一天……我跟病人提到以前梦想当偶像，\n病人就说我一定当得上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4ba67f307ff3008f7c392dfd134104ef7198c00219c580f0d94bd02d44b49330", "ja": "患者さんに？", "zh": "病人跟你说的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "661a34dcafcdc659580618c3ab2e90b972bd92249048369a6d38c3b77be07dd3", "ja": "それに、私がアイドルになったら元気が出るって。\n……それで、改めて挑戦しようと思ったんです！", "zh": "而且，那位病人还说看到我当偶像就会恢复活力。\n……于是我才决定重新来挑战看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "68bc8e8275dd3207ce3bc4f8579aea06559efac96ed666ca2b1371517f293097", "ja": "なるほど……。", "zh": "原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "466905f915a02c15acb453c1a723b956391ba8b99aab2fc0527b0bed311442b9", "ja": "こんな形でオーディションに挑戦できる日が\n来るなんて、自分でも少し驚いてます。", "zh": "没想到会因为这样而来挑战偶像甄选，\n我自己也有些吃惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "996a06bce3b296fa8fac1ad73e4589b15fac25c5a4e31ddf86597db1a8498568", "ja": "（人のお世話が嫌いじゃない、か。患者さんのことを\n話す時の笑顔を見れば、嘘じゃないことがわかる）", "zh": "（「挺喜欢照顾人」，是吧？\n看到她谈论病人时的笑容就知道，那不是骗人的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_1020", "source_sha256": "7df6182ec760fa42d7f8d07d2644ec542715d0ff0c67d9c793f05ce36082bb94", "ja": "合格印を押す", "zh": "盖下录取印章", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e59a9f5474fa5ca545cb59284fed18c7ddaeb32d39bcbeb626aee67b0b398071", "ja": "誰かに喜んでもらいたいという気持ちがあるのは、\nアイドルとしていいことだよ。合格だ！", "zh": "想要造福他人，\n这样的想法对偶像是加分的，恭喜你录取了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f5fa3cb5a7deb725658a4e4e07a03dce9fd52342a89023bd7d201945c2a2a5a2", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか！？\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "真、真的吗！？\n非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_2002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3385e2c4f9fd14f9cda577bc9af4eb9a25e75a66d57497e763bcae64d5b39082", "ja": "これで応援してくれた患者さん達にも、\nいい報告ができます……♪", "zh": "这样就能向支持我的病人们\n报告好消息了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "26a8ec99e67dd64b43025a25484da6028178cc5f5a2c2a377d2bd1731c843a3d", "ja": "そうだ、参考として聞いておきたいんだけど、\nどんなアイドルを目指したいのかな？", "zh": "对了，我想要请教你一件事情当作参考，\n你想要成为怎样的偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_2004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "80163e701c326a85287e4fea0d2ebdd87205b11358a88b96c2a2157a32f368bb", "ja": "はい！\nもちろん、正統派アイドルですっ！", "zh": "是！\n我想成为正统派偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_2005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "85b7118ead8d9fee5498f807424b150bc09aa8bd57a628ab644d80b3c5b6ce97", "ja": "たくさんの人に、元気になってもらえる……\nそんなアイドルになりたいんです♪", "zh": "我希望让许多人都能获得活力……\n我想要成为那样的偶像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "c2d28a9c9ef7bd8d6fc10c4ece53fad6e57fda94ea7bb28a11a84f972c1cb58a", "ja": "（正統派か……）", "zh": "（正统派是吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "59ca4a1649ff4e1b773dbf314e4d03f07a38fe301431d8ad5d9959eb66cb4a3c", "ja": "（よし。追々考えていこう！）", "zh": "（好，以后再慢慢想吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
